kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "generation-observability-and-guardrails"
purpose: 定义生成链路的可观测性与运行护栏：trace 关联、阶段耗时、错误分类、并发限制、重试边界与任务队列行为。
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[9]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r32,Each generation request has a trace_id,每次生成请求 MUST 有可关联 `trace_id`，并贯穿关键日志。
  r90,Stage timing fields are standardized,关键阶段日志 MUST 记录标准化耗时字段（如 embed/search/db/format）。
  r127,Error classification is normalized,失败日志 MUST 记录标准错误分类字段（如 `error_kind`）与重试/fallback 信息。
  r163,Cache hit/miss is observable,使用检索缓存时 MUST 记录 hit/miss，并尽可能携带 trace_id。
  r198,Retry boundaries are not stacked,同一失败链路 MUST 避免多层叠加重试导致放大延迟。
  r228,Concurrency and cancellation guardrails are enforced,生成与后台任务 MUST 有阶段级并发上限与取消语义。
  r251,Background workers shutdown gracefully,后台任务队列 worker MUST 支持优雅停机与终态等待行为。
  "retry-honors-retry-after","Retry MUST honor Retry-After header and include full retryable codes","AI 调用重试 MUST 解析并遵守响应的 Retry-After 头，且可重试状态码集合 MUST 包含 408/409/425/429/500/502/503/504"
  "retry-timeout-budget",Retry MUST enforce timeout budget and max delay,AI 调用重试 MUST 实施 total timeout 预算和 max delay 上限，避免无限退避
scenarios[9]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r32,"logs-are-traceable","",系统处理一次生成请求并输出关键日志,这些日志 SHALL 关联同一个 `trace_id`,true
  r90,"timing-fields-are-present","",生成链路经过 embed/search/db/format 等关键阶段,系统 SHALL 在日志中记录标准化耗时字段,true
  r127,"failure-logs-include-classification","",生成请求失败,系统 SHALL 记录 `error_kind` 等分类字段以及重试/fallback 信息,true
  r163,"cache-decision-is-observable","",系统读取检索缓存并发生命中或未命中,系统 SHALL 记录 hit/miss，并尽可能携带 `trace_id`,true
  r198,"retries-do-not-amplify-latency","",上游与下游组件都具备重试能力,系统 SHALL 只在明确边界执行重试而非层层叠加,true
  r228,"concurrency-limits-are-enforced","",并发请求超过阶段级上限或用户发起取消,系统 SHALL 按上限进行限流/排队，并按取消语义停止相关任务,true
  r251,"worker-shutdown-is-graceful","",worker 收到停机信号,worker SHALL 进行优雅停机并等待任务到达可接受的终态,true
  "retry-honors-retry-after","rate-limit-with-retry-after","provider 返回 429 且 Retry-After: 60",retry 逻辑处理,系统 SHALL 等待 60 秒后重试而非使用指数退避,true
  "retry-timeout-budget","bounded-backoff",连续多次 503 错误,retry 退避计算,退避延迟 SHALL 不超过 max_delay 上限且总时间不超过 total timeout 预算,true
